OL,3,GNEWSAStreets flooded, travel disrupted,
OL,4,Aand power off for thousands as Storm
OL,5,ABoelo hits UK
OL,6,
OL,7,FThere's disruption on the railways; a
OL,8,Fnumber of flights have been cancelled -
OL,9,Fincluding more than 20 from Leeds
OL,10,FBradford; while many ferry services are
OL,11,Falso suspended
OL,13,FAmber warnings for wind remain in place
OL,14,Facross large parts of Scotland and
OL,15,Fnorthern England - one grandmother in
OL,16,FLancashire tells us how a tree fell on
OL,17,Fher car as she watched Strictly
